WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880
This kid seems to have gone astray

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,760
There are now less than three years until the extension of the campaign

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:06,000
I can't let him insult Qi Tu Su Yuan

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,520
There are many ways to solve problems

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,360
Doesn’t that mean you have to rely on violence? Do you understand?

6
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,440
But I just feel

7
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:11,640
You saved our family with a gun

8
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,640
majestic look

9
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,960
That's what I want to be

10
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,360
Don't look at me. You always save me with a gun.

11
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:16,560
majestic

12
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,840
How can people compare with each other from time to time?

13
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,840
It's not as good as tomorrow, someone will point a gun at you.

14
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,240
So it indicates that it can be resolved peacefully

15
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,320
Just resolve it peacefully

16
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:26,680
You must never use Dou Hun, understand?

17
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:29,120
Seems like I understand a little bit and it's okay

18
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:35,110
When you are older you will understand Jianguo

19
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:36,470
Your kid is back

20
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:39,930
Uncle Tie is so anxious to wait for you. Uncle Tie is so anxious.

21
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,690
Are you interested in the distinguished guests of Gray Star Sand?

22
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:42,770
Isn't it?

23
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:45,250
He is a distinguished guest from the county. I heard from others

24
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,450
We have giant gray star sand here

25
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:48,830
Came here specially

26
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:50,590
I placed people at my acquisition points.

27
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:51,630
If you never come back

28
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:52,670
I even want to borrow a bicycle

29
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:55,470
I will go to the Dragon King Temple to find you Jianguo in person.

30
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:58,430
You haven't said what you're going to have for dinner tonight.

31
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,630
Sold Gray Star Sand

32
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:08,180
Eat whatever you want, Boss Jin

33
00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:12,640
I brought you the man

34
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,920
It turns out to be you
